The code in this directory (which compiles to the VNL library within
VW) is an adapted version of the vnl "Vision Numerics Library" part of
the larger VXL "Vision-something-Libraries" developed and released as
free software by an international team from academia and industry. See
the VXL homepage at http://vxl.sourceforge.net/ for more information.

We call the VW-ised version VNL to differentiate it from the original
vnl, and VNL is no longer compatible with vnl and the rest of VXL
because the classes and functions of VNL have been adapted to fit in
with the VW style and naming conventions.

vnl, and therefore the derived work VNL, are licensed under the VXL
License as follows (from
http://cvs.sourceforge.net/viewcvs.py/vxl/vxl/core/vxl_copyright.h?rev=HEAD):


